Canonical project name: Video Idea System
Skill identifier: video-idea-system

This project is an open-source, review-gated short-video ideation and content
Skill. It covers creative divergence, source grounding and content working
memory, a conversational Story Battle, a record-ready spoken script, a per-screen
content contract with a rough real-material sample, and a single read-aloud
review face that the author reads through and confirms before any production
work starts.

The read-aloud review face is served by the shared review seam
(`planners-review-core`) and is meant to run locally only. This Skill does not
cut, render, or encode video.

Attribution and source identification may appear in repository documents,
process HTML pages, review server pages, validation pages, and developer
workflow surfaces. The Skill should not add project branding to final client
deliverables by default unless the user explicitly requests it.
